    "Increase downward correction magnitude when sentiment is positive (e.g., +0.50) and price is trending down — avoid overconfidence in upside.",
    "Lag correction: if model predicts a spike 2-3 days ahead, reduce by 10-20% to account for delayed market reaction.",
    "Avoid overreacting to single-day sentiment shifts — smooth transitions with 3-5 day moving average filter for sentiment signals."
